'Yulang.GeneralDictionary170PathBound.rank_budget' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
@Yulang.GeneralDictionary170PathBound.rank_budget : ∀ {registry : Yulang.GeneralDeclarations.Registry}
  {roles : Yulang.Roles.RoleDecls} {state : Yulang.GeneralNominalSupport.Tracked roles}
  {domain : Yulang.GeneralSourceDictionaries.Occurrence roles → Prop} {start finish : Subtype domain} {count : Nat}
  (coverage : Yulang.GeneralDictionary170NamedCoverage.Coverage registry state domain),
  Yulang.GeneralDictionary170PathBound.Path coverage start finish count →
    count + Yulang.GeneralDictionary170NamedAccessible.rank state finish.val ≤
      Yulang.GeneralDictionary170NamedAccessible.rank state start.val
'Yulang.GeneralDictionary170PathBound.length_le_rank' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
