'Yulang.GeneralDictionary170PathBound.no_positive_cycle' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
@Yulang.GeneralDictionary170PathBound.no_positive_cycle : ∀ {registry : Yulang.GeneralDeclarations.Registry}
